<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>MyLife + BestChef — Architecture Tour</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0B0B10;
  --bg-1:#0E0E13;
  --bg-2:#131318;
  --bg-3:#1B1B20;
  --bg-4:#2A292F;
  --bg-5:#35343A;
  --text:#E4E1E9;
  --text-2:rgba(214,195,181,0.72);
  --text-3:rgba(214,195,181,0.48);
  --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  --border-strong:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
  --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  --glass-strong:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  --mylife:#FFB877;
  --mylife-2:#C9894D;
  --bestchef:#22C55E;
  --bestchef-2:#16A34A;
  --info:#8BCFF0;
  --warn:#F4A261;
  --danger:#FFB4AB;
  --ok:#30D158;
  --purple:#A78BFA;
  --pink:#F472B6;
  --teal:#2DD4BF;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;font-feature-settings:"ss01","cv11";-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
body{overflow-x:hidden}
code,pre,.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}
a{color:var(--info);text-decoration:none}
a:hover{text-decoration:underline}

/* Layout */
.shell{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 28px 120px}
header.hero{
  position:relative;padding:96px 32px 72px;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;
  background:
    radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 20% 0%, rgba(255,184,119,0.18), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(900px 500px at 90% 30%, rgba(34,197,94,0.16), transparent 65%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, #131318 0%, #0E0E13 100%);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
}
header.hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,64px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 16px;font-weight:800}
header.hero .eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:18px;font-weight:600}
header.hero p.lede{font-size:18px;color:var(--text-2);max-width:780px;line-height:1.6}
header.hero .meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:24px}
header.hero .pill{padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);font-weight:500}
header.hero .pill.mylife{border-color:rgba(255,184,119,0.4);color:#FFD3A8;background:rgba(255,184,119,0.08)}
header.hero .pill.bestchef{border-color:rgba(34,197,94,0.45);color:#86EFAC;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.10)}

section{margin-top:80px}
section h2{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:700}
section h2 .num{display:inline-block;color:var(--text-3);margin-right:14px;font-weight:600;font-feature-settings:"tnum"}
section .sub{color:var(--text-2);max-width:880px;margin:0 0 28px;line-height:1.6}
section .sub strong{color:var(--text)}

/* Cards & grids */
.grid{display:grid;gap:18px}
.grid.two{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
.grid.three{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}
.grid.four{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}
@media(max-width:900px){.grid.two,.grid.three,.grid.four{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.card{background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;padding:22px;position:relative;transition:transform .25s ease,border-color .25s ease}
.card:hover{border-color:var(--border-strong);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.card h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.card .kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:600}
.card p{color:var(--text-2);font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:6px 0 0}
.card.mylife{border-color:rgba(255,184,119,0.22)}
.card.bestchef{border-color:rgba(34,197,94,0.30)}
.card.warn{border-color:rgba(244,162,97,0.35)}

/* Legend */
.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.legend .chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);font-weight:500}
.legend .chip .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}
.legend .chip code{font-size:11px;color:var(--text);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px}

/* 3D world */
.world-wrap{position:relative;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:radial-gradient(900px 500px at 50% 30%, rgba(255,184,119,0.10), transparent 60%), #0A0A0F}
#world{display:block;width:100%;height:680px;cursor:grab}
#world:active{cursor:grabbing}
.world-overlay{position:absolute;top:18px;left:18px;right:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;pointer-events:none;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.world-overlay .panel{background:rgba(11,11,16,0.78);backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(140%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(140%);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;pointer-events:auto;max-width:380px}
.world-overlay .panel h4{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.02em}
.world-overlay .panel p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.55}
.world-overlay .panel .row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3)}
.world-overlay .panel button{background:var(--glass-strong);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-weight:500}
.world-overlay .panel button:hover{background:rgba(255,184,119,0.12);border-color:rgba(255,184,119,0.5)}
.world-overlay .panel button.active{background:rgba(255,184,119,0.18);border-color:rgba(255,184,119,0.6);color:#FFD3A8}
.world-tooltip{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;background:rgba(11,11,16,0.92);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);max-width:280px;line-height:1.5;display:none;z-index:10;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}
.world-tooltip strong{color:var(--mylife)}
.world-tooltip .sub{display:block;color:var(--text-3);font-size:11px;margin-top:4px}
.world-legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
.world-legend .chip{font-size:10px;padding:5px 9px}

/* SVG diagrams */
.diagram{background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;padding:24px;overflow:hidden}
.diagram svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.diagram .caption{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:12px;text-align:center}

/* ERD */
.erd-wrap{background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;padding:24px}
.erd{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:14px}
.tbl{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-3),var(--bg-2));border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;font-size:12px;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s}
.tbl:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--bestchef)}
.tbl header{padding:10px 12px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.10);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-strong);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.tbl.local header{background:rgba(255,184,119,0.10)}
.tbl.cloud header{background:rgba(34,197,94,0.10)}
.tbl.shared header{background:rgba(167,139,250,0.10)}
.tbl header .name{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)}
.tbl header .scope{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:600}
.tbl ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:6px 0;max-height:180px;overflow:auto}
.tbl li{padding:4px 12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
.tbl li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.tbl li.pk{color:#FFD3A8;font-weight:600}
.tbl li.fk{color:#86EFAC}
.tbl li .type{color:var(--text-3);font-size:10px}

/* Workflow timeline */
.flow{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
@media(max-width:900px){.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.flow .step{background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:18px;position:relative}
.flow .step .num{position:absolute;top:-14px;left:18px;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;background:var(--bestchef);color:#062B12}
.flow .step h4{margin:6px 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
.flow .step p{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.55;margin:0}
.flow .step .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--glass-strong);color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px;font-weight:600}

/* Stack columns */
.stack-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
@media(max-width:900px){.stack-cols{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.stack-col{background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:16px}
.stack-col h5{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3);margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:600}
.stack-col ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
.stack-col li{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--glass);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:center;border:1px solid transparent;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
.stack-col li:hover{border-color:var(--border-strong);background:var(--glass-strong)}
.stack-col li .v{color:var(--text-3);font-size:11px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}

/* Modules grid */
.modules{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(120px,1fr));gap:8px}
.mod{aspect-ratio:1;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:8px;text-align:center;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s,background .2s;cursor:default;position:relative}
.mod:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--mylife);background:rgba(255,184,119,0.06)}
.mod .icon{font-size:24px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px}
.mod .name{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)}
.mod .pf{font-size:9px;color:var(--text-3);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;margin-top:2px}
.mod[data-tier="free"]{box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(48,209,88,0.4)}
.mod[data-tier="premium"]{box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(167,139,250,0.4)}
.mod[data-tier="hidden"]{opacity:0.55;box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.10)}
.mod[data-spotlight="bestchef"]{border-color:var(--bestchef);background:rgba(34,197,94,0.10)}

/* Compare table */
.compare{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;font-size:13px}
.compare th,.compare td{padding:12px 16px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.compare th{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3);background:var(--bg-3);font-weight:600}
.compare tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
.compare td.dim{color:var(--text-3)}
.compare td strong{color:var(--text)}
.compare .yes{color:var(--ok);font-weight:600}
.compare .no{color:var(--danger);font-weight:600}
.compare .partial{color:var(--warn);font-weight:600}

/* Risk callouts */
.callouts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:14px}
.callout{padding:18px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--bg-2);border-left:3px solid var(--info)}
.callout.warn{border-left-color:var(--warn)}
.callout.danger{border-left-color:var(--danger)}
.callout.ok{border-left-color:var(--ok)}
.callout h5{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.callout p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.55}
.callout .label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}

/* tooltip generic */
[data-tip]{position:relative}
[data-tip]:hover::after{
  content:attr(data-tip);position:absolute;bottom:calc(100% + 8px);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  background:rgba(11,11,16,0.95);color:var(--text);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;
  border:1px solid var(--border-strong);white-space:nowrap;z-index:50;
  font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;pointer-events:none;
  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}

/* Insight box */
.insight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(139,207,240,0.08),rgba(167,139,250,0.06));border:1px solid rgba(139,207,240,0.25);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin-top:20px}
.insight .label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--info);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}
.insight ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}
.insight li{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:4px}

/* Footer */
footer{margin-top:96px;padding-top:32px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}

/* Print */
@media print{
  body{background:#fff;color:#111}
  #world{display:none}
  .card,.diagram,.erd-wrap,.stack-col,.compare,.tbl{break-inside:avoid}
}

/* Section nav */
.toc{position:sticky;top:14px;background:rgba(11,11,16,0.78);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:10px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;z-index:20;margin-bottom:24px}
.toc a{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.02em}
.toc a:hover{background:var(--glass-strong);color:var(--text);text-decoration:none}

/* Misc */
.hr{height:1px;background:var(--border);border:0;margin:48px 0}
.kbd{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;background:var(--bg-3);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-bottom-width:2px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text)}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="shell">

<header class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">MyLife · BestChef · Architecture Tour</div>
  <h1>One workspace. Two data philosophies.</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    MyLife is a privacy-first <strong>multi-module hub</strong> built on a peer-to-peer mesh sync substrate. BestChef is a public, social, server-backed product that ships out of that same monorepo using a <strong>standard Supabase server</strong> as its source of truth. This document walks technical and non-technical teammates through both systems: the 3D mesh world, the BestChef server stack, the database, the workflows, and the reasoning behind the split.
  </p>
  <div class="meta">
    <span class="pill mylife">MyLife · 39 modules · iOS · Android · Web</span>
    <span class="pill bestchef">BestChef · standalone Expo app · public launch</span>
    <span class="pill">SQLite local · Supabase cloud · Mesh CRDT</span>
    <span class="pill">TypeScript · Expo · Next.js 15 · Turborepo · pnpm</span>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
  <a href="#legend">Legend</a>
  <a href="#mesh-world">Mesh 3D World</a>
  <a href="#mylife-arch">MyLife Architecture</a>
  <a href="#bestchef-arch">BestChef Architecture</a>
  <a href="#bestchef-db">BestChef Database</a>
  <a href="#bestchef-flows">User Workflows</a>
  <a href="#features">Feature Map</a>
  <a href="#stack">Tech Stack</a>
  <a href="#modules">Module Inventory</a>
  <a href="#compare">Mesh vs Server</a>
  <a href="#risks">Risks &amp; Production Work</a>
</nav>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- LEGEND -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<section id="legend">
  <h2><span class="num">01</span>Legend</h2>
  <p class="sub">Color and shape coding used across every diagram in this document. Hover any chip for the meaning, and watch for these conventions in the 3D world below.</p>

  <div class="grid two">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="kicker">Color</div>
      <div class="legend">
        <span class="chip" data-tip="Hub orange — the MyLife shell, suite-level features, and unified dashboard."><span class="dot" style="background:var(--mylife)"></span>MyLife shell</span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="BestChef green — the standalone competitive recipe app and its server."><span class="dot" style="background:var(--bestchef)"></span>BestChef</span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="Info blue — informational nodes, tertiary state, links."><span class="dot" style="background:var(--info)"></span>Info / link</span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="Purple — premium-tier modules, encrypted relay, non-default privileged state."><span class="dot" style="background:var(--purple)"></span>Premium / privileged</span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="Pink — community workspaces and shared social surfaces."><span class="dot" style="background:var(--pink)"></span>Community workspace</span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="Teal — published blobs and authoritative cloud catalogs."><span class="dot" style="background:var(--teal)"></span>Published / canonical</span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="Warn amber — partial work, not yet shipped."><span class="dot" style="background:var(--warn)"></span>In progress</span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="Danger red — launch blocker, do-not-ship state."><span class="dot" style="background:var(--danger)"></span>Blocker</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="kicker">Shape / Scope</div>
      <div class="legend">
        <span class="chip" data-tip="Sphere = a personal device (iOS, Android, Web)."><span class="dot" style="background:#fff"></span>Device (sphere)</span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="Ring = a workspace boundary. Personal, group, or community."><span class="dot" style="border:2px solid #fff;background:transparent"></span>Workspace (ring)</span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="device_local — never leaves device. e.g. drafts, sync secrets."><code>device_local</code></span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="personal_replica — replicates only across this user's devices."><code>personal_replica</code></span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="shared_workspace — encrypted bilateral sync inside a paired workspace."><code>shared_workspace</code></span>
        <span class="chip" data-tip="published_blob — public, server-canonical (BestChef public catalogs ride this rail)."><code>published_blob</code></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="insight">
    <div class="label">★ Reading guide</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Every entity in MyLife declares a <code>syncPolicy</code> with a <strong>maxScope</strong> cap. Security lives in the payload, not the channel.</li>
      <li>BestChef public users ride a <strong>standard server-backed</strong> path (Supabase Auth + Postgres/RLS + Storage + Edge Functions). Local SQLite is an offline cache, not the source of truth.</li>
      <li>Both philosophies coexist because they have different threat models: MyLife protects private personal data; BestChef serves a public social product.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- MESH WORLD -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<section id="mesh-world">
  <h2><span class="num">02</span>The MyLife Mesh — Living Globe</h2>
  <p class="sub">A real Earth, fully zoomable. <strong>Drag to spin, scroll to zoom in/out.</strong> Far out, you see global <strong>clusters</strong> with device counts and dashed-cyan sync arcs jumping between regions. As you zoom in, clusters expand into individual <strong>workspace rings</strong> with personal, group, and community devices wrapped to the planet's surface. Hover any node for details. The Privileged Hub at geosynchronous orbit is the optional cloud replica that stores ciphertext blobs only.</p>

  <div class="world-wrap">
    <canvas id="world"></canvas>
    <div class="world-overlay">
      <div class="panel">
        <h4>MyLife Mesh · Earth view</h4>
        <p>Each pin is a real-world community of users. Dashed arcs are encrypted sync channels chosen by the ranked-choice transport ladder. Zoom in on a region to expand its cluster into individual devices and workspaces.</p>
        <div class="row">
          <button id="btn-rotate" class="active">Auto-rotate</button>
          <button id="btn-arcs" class="active">Sync arcs</button>
          <button id="btn-clouds">Atmosphere</button>
          <button id="btn-night" class="active">Night side</button>
          <button id="btn-focus">Focus random</button>
        </div>
        <div class="world-legend">
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot" style="background:#FFB877"></span>Personal cluster</span>
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot" style="background:#A78BFA"></span>Group cluster</span>
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot" style="background:#F472B6"></span>Community cluster</span>
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot" style="background:#2DD4BF"></span>Privileged hub</span>
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot" style="background:#86EFAC"></span>Active sync arc</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel" style="max-width:280px">
        <h4>Transport ladder</h4>
        <p style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.55">
          1. LAN Wi-Fi / Bonjour<br>
          2. Apple Multipeer / Wi-Fi Direct<br>
          3. BLE wake-up pings<br>
          4. WebRTC<br>
          5. Encrypted relay (ciphertext only)<br>
          6. Server replica (opt-in)
        </p>
        <div id="zoom-readout" style="margin-top:10px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3)">zoom: globe · clusters visible</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="world-tip" class="world-tooltip"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="insight">
    <div class="label">★ What you're seeing</div>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Personal ring (orange):</strong> all of one user's devices. Drafts and secrets are <code>device_local</code>; module state is <code>personal_replica</code> across these spheres only.</li>
      <li><strong>Group ring (purple):</strong> a paired workspace (family budget, couple's dining, household). Requires fingerprint-compare pairing for sensitive modules.</li>
      <li><strong>Community ring (pink):</strong> larger shared workspace. Modules with <code>maxScope: shared_workspace</code> can replicate here; sensitive modules cap below this scope.</li>
      <li><strong>Privileged hub (teal core):</strong> opt-in cloud replica for durability and recovery. Stores ciphertext blobs addressed by ephemeral tokens — the server cannot read content.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- MYLIFE ARCHITECTURE -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<section id="mylife-arch">
  <h2><span class="num">03</span>MyLife Hub Architecture</h2>
  <p class="sub">A single Expo app and a single Next.js app render <strong>any</strong> registered module. Modules are not separate apps; they are <code>ModuleDefinition</code> records loaded by the registry at runtime. All local data lives in one SQLite file with prefixed tables, so cross-module features (Mood × Sleep × Habits) are just SQL joins.</p>

  <div class="diagram">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1280 580" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="MyLife layered architecture">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="lg-mylife" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#FFB877" stop-opacity="0.18"/>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#FFB877" stop-opacity="0.04"/>
