      <text x="60" y="266" fill="#D8C9FF" font-size="11" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="2">MODULES — 30 LOCAL · 9 CLOUD/HYBRID</text>

      <g font-size="10" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.75)">
