        <path d="M440,116 L440,150"/>
        <path d="M700,116 L700,150"/>
        <path d="M750,202 L750,240"/>
        <path d="M640,346 L640,380"/>
        <path d="M640,460 L640,484"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
    <div class="caption">Layered view: host apps → registry → modules → shared packages → storage tiers. <span style="color:var(--bestchef)">apps/bestchef</span> sits beside the host apps but ships independently and uses Supabase as its public source of truth.</div>
  </div>
</section>

